WEBVTT

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:01.440
Click Post to Market

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:02.490
in the left sidebar,

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.020
then choose Available.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.370
First, make

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:06.440
sure these are vehicles

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:07.960
from the dealership and location

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:09.220
you intend to advertise.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.510
If the inventory looks wrong,

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:12.790
don't start a post.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.230
On a dealer account,

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.320
tell your manager.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.060
On an individual account,

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.580
contact the AutoLander

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:19.860
admin through Support.

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:21.840
Use the search box

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:22.960
or the filters above

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:23.990
the vehicles to find

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.010
the car you want.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:26.410
Check its identity,

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:28.120
price and mileage against

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:29.460
the dealership's information.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.850
The photos

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:32.450
come from your inventory source;

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:33.790
an AI option

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:34.970
doesn't correct missing

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.770
or inaccurate source details.

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:38.460
Click the selection

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:39.840
box on a vehicle card.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:41.420
You can select more than

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:42.680
one, and the Post

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:43.980
to Marketplace button shows

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:45.080
how many you've chosen.

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:46.400
Keep the cards

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.530
and that button in view

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:48.910
while you check the selection.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:51.100
Leave AI Background off

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.600
to use the original photos,

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.040
or choose an optional

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.160
treatment after checking

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:56.600
its displayed credit cost.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:00:57.800
We'll cover those

00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:59.160
choices in the AI lesson.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:00.440
When you're ready

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:01.520
for an intended post,

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.440
click Post to Marketplace.

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:04.510
The work

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:05.530
moves to the Queue.

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:07.190
For this practice,

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:08.410
select one suitable

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:10.190
vehicle and explain your checks.

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:11.430
You can stop

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:12.630
before the posting button.
